Note on optional dependencies:

`mutagen` (used for reading embedded audio tags) is distributed under the
GPL-2.0-or-later license. It is declared as an *optional* extra
(`pip install "renomate[audio]"`) and imported dynamically at runtime; this
project does not link against or redistribute its code, and remains MIT
licensed. When the `audio` extra is not installed, `mutagen` is never loaded.
